<title>USA: Datascope Corp Q1 oper net falls.</title>
<headline>Datascope Corp Q1 oper net falls.</headline>
<dateline>MONTVALE, N.J. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>DATASCOPE CORP.</p>
<p>Summary of Operating Results (Unaudited)</p>
<p>					   3 Months Ended</p>
<p>					   9/30/96		  9/30/95</p>
<p> Net Sales			 $47,600,000	    $45,900,000</p>
<p>Earnings Before Litigation</p>
<p> Settlement Expense		1,800,000		3,102,000</p>
<p>Litigation Settlement Expense</p>
<p>				     (5,098,000)			 --</p>
<p> Net Earnings (Loss) (A)     (3,298,000)		3,102,000</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share Before</p>
<p> Litigation Settlement Expense	0.11		     0.19</p>
<p>Earnings (Loss) Per</p>
<p>  Share  (A)			   ( 0.20)		     0.19</p>
<p>Weighted Average Common</p>
<p> Shares Outstanding	     16,237,000	     16,428,000</p>
<p>(A) Includes shareholder class action securities lawsuit settlement expense of $5,550,000, or $3,291,000 after income tax, equivalent to $0.20 per share, and patent infringement lawsuit settlement expense of $3,004,000, or $1,807,000 after income tax, equivalent to $0.11 per share.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
